        "verification_status": "Wrong Match",
        "bio": "Rui is a PhD student in Management and Organizations at Kellogg School of Management in Northwestern University. She is also affiliated with the Center for Science of Science and Innovation (CSSI). Her research investigates creativity and innovation processes in both team dynamics and individual careers. Her studies employ computational text analysis, network analysis, and online experiments. Before her Ph.D., Rui researched in the Knowledge Lab during her master’s study at the University of Chicago. She holds dual B.A. degrees in Philosophy and Economics from Peking University, China."
