        "bio": "Bill has been wearing multiple hats – researcher, engineer, and lately, tech adventurer. \nCurrently, he is the co-founder and CTO of Pond, a startup focused on building the foundation model for crypto AI. \nThroughout his career, whether in industry (TigerGraph, Amazon) or academia (UNC, UChicago), Bill has been driven by a passion for applying mathematical modeling and machine learning to solve real-world challenges. \nHis work spans a wide range of fields, from graph AI, recommender systems, to computational social science and biomedicine.\n",
